    "body": "Just to make sure I'm understanding correctly: it looks like these could all be run as unit tests from within the module, if it weren't for the fact that you want to test things with the actual hostname/configs? (Excellent suite of tests, by the way)\r\n\r\nIs there any way at all that these tests could fail if run in a production environment? Non-ignored tests failing will stop certain installation methods, so I'd like to be extra-sure. Looking over them once, my gut feeling is \"no\", but I might have missed something.",
