    "body": "We generally don't display error conditions directly in the prompt. \r\n\r\nThe preferred technique (that I've seen so far) is to make the module `None` in the event of an error, and then use `log::debug()` to emit a logging message that can be seen if the user runs with the right envars. See, for example, [battery.rs:23](https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/08aef016cdb1dbf53fc50b6e31ab0add2f40856b/src/modules/battery.rs#L23)",
